  description: The Bulwark's big sibling - a shield that walks, built by someone
    who believed the best weapon is the enemy's wasted time.
  tactics: Fourteen HP of pure blockade with painful contact damage. Aegis walls
    come escorted - Wardens hide behind them lobbing homing bolts. Breaking the shield
    head-on costs seconds you may not have; going around costs position. Decide fast,
    commit fully.
